  "notes": [
    "Authentic Apple availability generator, version DSL, and header templates. Buck generates the installed header tree with the upstream --preprocess interface; no compilation/linking driver is used.",
    "APSL 2.0 and Apache 2.0 notices are retained in the respective source headers; standalone license texts are included because the upstream archive omits them.",
    "Generated header root must precede EXTERNAL_HEADERS and any generated os/availability.h shim, so Availability.h and its internal/legacy/private/version headers come from one provider.",
    "The upstream generator and build/test actions have not been executed during vendoring."
